text_prompt_template:
USER: Scene description:
{caption}

Infer this scene's annotations under the five moral foundations. Return exactly one JSON object with keys care, fairness, loyalty, authority, sanctity, and non_moral. For each foundation use exactly one of virtue, vice, or not_annotated. The virtue/vice pairs are care: Care/Harm; fairness: Fairness/Cheating; loyalty: Loyalty/Betrayal; authority: Respect/Subversion; sanctity: Sanctity/Degradation. not_annotated means that neither pole is annotated in this dataset; it does not assert morally neutral content. non_moral must be a JSON boolean, true exactly when all five foundations are not_annotated. Include all six keys and no other keys. Do not include explanations, captions, or text outside the JSON object. ASSISTANT:
